{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "_memo = {}\ndef sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence using memoization.\"\"\"\n    \"\"\"P(1)=1, P(2)=1, P(n) = P(P(n-1)) + P(n-P(n-1)) for n > 2.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 2:\n        return 1\n\n    if n in _memo:\n        return _memo[n]\n\n    p_n_minus_1 = sequence(n - 1)\n    result = sequence(p_n_minus_1) + sequence(n - p_n_minus_1)\n    \n    _memo[n] = result\n    return result"}
