{"task_id": "Mbpp/223", "solution": "def is_majority(arr: list[int], n: int, x: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if an element 'x' is a majority element in a sorted array 'arr' of length 'n'.\n    A majority element occurs more than n/2 times.\n    \"\"\"\n    first_occurrence_index = -1\n    low, high = 0, n - 1\n    while low <= high:\n        mid = (low + high) // 2\n        if arr[mid] == x:\n            first_occurrence_index = mid\n            high = mid - 1\n        elif arr[mid] < x:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:\n            high = mid - 1\n\n    if first_occurrence_index == -1:\n        return False\n\n    required_count = n // 2 + 1\n\n    if (first_occurrence_index + required_count - 1 < n and\n            arr[first_occurrence_index + required_count - 1] == x):\n        return True\n    else:\n        return False"}
