{"task_id": "Mbpp/290", "solution": "def max_length(list_of_lists: list) -> tuple:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the list of maximum length in a list of lists.\n    Returns a tuple of (maximum_length, max_length_list).\n    \"\"\"\n    if not list_of_lists:\n        return (0, [])\n\n    max_len = 0\n    max_list = []\n\n    for sublist in list_of_lists:\n        current_len = len(sublist)\n        if current_len > max_len:\n            max_len = current_len\n            max_list = sublist\n\n    return (max_len, max_list)"}
