{"task_id": "Mbpp/299", "solution": "def max_aggregate(score_entries: list[tuple[str, int]]) -> tuple[str | None, int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the maximum aggregate score from a list of (name, score) tuples.\n    Returns the name and their total score, or (None, 0) if the input list is empty.\n    \"\"\"\n    aggregated_scores = {}\n\n    for name, score in score_entries:\n        aggregated_scores[name] = aggregated_scores.get(name, 0) + score\n\n    if not aggregated_scores:\n        return (None, 0)\n\n    max_name = None\n    max_score = 0\n\n    for name, score_total in aggregated_scores.items():\n        if score_total > max_score:\n            max_score = score_total\n            max_name = name\n\n    return (max_name, max_score)"}
