{"task_id": "Mbpp/620", "solution": "def find_largest_divisible_subset_size(numbers: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the size of the largest subset of a list of numbers\n    so that every pair within the subset is mutually divisible.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(numbers)\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    if n == 1:\n        return 1\n\n    numbers.sort()\n    dp = [1] * n\n    max_size = 1\n\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        for j in range(i):\n            if numbers[i] % numbers[j] == 0:\n                dp[i] = max(dp[i], dp[j] + 1)\n        max_size = max(max_size, dp[i])\n\n    return max_size"}
