{"task_id": "Mbpp/745", "solution": "def divisible_by_digits(startnum: int, endnum: int) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"Finds numbers within a given range where every number is divisible by every digit it contains.\"\"\"\n\n    def _get_digits(number: int) -> list[int]:\n        \"\"\"Extracts a list of individual digits from an integer.\"\"\"\n        return [int(digit) for digit in str(number)]\n\n    def _is_self_divisible(number: int) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if a single number is divisible by all its non-zero digits.\"\"\"\n        digits = _get_digits(number)\n        for digit in digits:\n            if digit == 0 or number % digit != 0:\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    result_list = []\n    for num in range(startnum, endnum + 1):\n        if _is_self_divisible(num):\n            result_list.append(num)\n    return result_list"}
