{"task_id": "Mbpp/748", "solution": "def capital_words_spaces(input_string: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Inserts spaces before capital letters in a string, excluding the first character.\"\"\"\n    if not input_string:\n        return \"\"\n\n    result = [input_string[0]]\n    for char in input_string[1:]:\n        if 'A' <= char <= 'Z':  # Check if the character is an uppercase letter\n            result.append(' ')\n        result.append(char)\n    return \"\".join(result)"}
